<title>USA: TENNIS-AMERICA'S RED CLAY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AMERICA'S RED CLAY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CORAL SPRINGS, Florida 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$245,000 America's Red Clay Tennis Championship on Friday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>1-Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) beat Juan Albert Viloca (Spain) 6-4</p>
<p>7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>4-Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) beat David Witt (U.S.) 6-1</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>Steve Campbell (U.S.) beat Sargis Sargsian (Armenia) 6-1 6-3</p>
<p>Johan Van Herck (Belgium) beat Mark Woodforde (Australia) 3-6</p>
<p>6-2 6-3</p>
</text>
